 feel and button-down collar.</p>','IC-RED-006',22,1,1,'\"[\\\"Yarn-Dyed Red Plaid Check Pattern\\\",\\\"Soft Brushed Cotton Feel\\\",\\\"Curved Hem for Untucked Look\\\",\\\"Chest Pocket with Brand Tab\\\"]\"','\"[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fabric\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"100% Cotton\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fit\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Casual Regular Fit\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Color\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Red & Black Check\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Sleeve\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Full Sleeve\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Collar\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Button-Down Collar\\\"}]\"','/storage/products/000000000000026.png','\"[\\\"/storage/products/000000000000026.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000027.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000028.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000029.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000030.png\\\"]\"',0,'2026-08-08 11:49:50','2026-08-08 11:49:50'),(148,'Denim Shirt - Dark Blue','<p>Dark blue denim shirt offering a rugged look with durable double stitching.</p>','IC-DBL-007',22,1,1,'\"[\\\"Heavy Cotton Indigo Denim\\\",\\\"Western Yoke & Double Flap Pockets\\\",\\\"Marble Snap Fasteners\\\",\\\"Enzyme Washed Soft Finish\\\"]\"','\"[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fabric\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"100% Cotton Denim\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fit\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Regular Fit\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Color\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Dark Blue Indigo\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Sleeve\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Full Sleeve\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Collar\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Spread Collar\\\"}]\"','/storage/products/000000000000031.png','\"[\\\"/storage/products/000000000000031.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000032.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000033.png\\\"]\"',0,'2026-08-08 11:49:50','2026-08-08 11:49:50'),(149,'Half Sleeve Summer Shirt - Yellow','<p>Bright yellow summer shirt made with lightweight cotton for warm sunny days.</p>','IC-YLW-008',22,1,1,'\"[\\\"Lightweight Summer Cotton Weave\\\",\\\"Relaxed Half Sleeve Cut\\\",\\\"Vibrant Sunshine Yellow Dye\\\",\\\"Breathable & Sweat-Absorbent\\\"]\"','\"[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fabric\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"100% Lightweight Cotton\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fit\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Relaxed Fit\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Color\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Sunshine Yellow\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Sleeve\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Half Sleeve\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Collar\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Cuban Collar\\\"}]\"','/storage/products/000000000000034.png','\"[\\\"/storage/products/000000000000034.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000035.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000036.png\\\"]\"',0,'2026-08-08 11:49:51','2026-08-14 10:04:14'),(150,'Printed Casual Shirt - Maroon','<p>Maroon printed shirt perfect for parties and casual evening gatherings.</p>','IC-MRN-009',22,1,1,'\"[\\\"All-Over Micro Motif Print\\\",\\\"Soft Cotton Rayon Blend\\\",\\\"Sleek Concealed Placket Detail\\\",\\\"Deep Maroon Rich Colorway\\\"]\"','\"[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fabric\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"80% Cotton, 20% Rayon\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fit\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Slim Fit\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Color\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Maroon\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Sleeve\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Full Sleeve\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Collar\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Spread Collar\\\"}]\"','/storage/products/000000000000037.png','\"[\\\"/storage/products/000000000000037.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000038.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000039.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000040.png\\\",\\\"/storage/products/000000000000041.png\\\"]\"',0,'2026-08-08 11:49:51','2026-08-08 11:49:51'),(151,'Stretch Fit Shirt - Teal Green','<p>Teal green stretch-fit shirt combining flexibility, modern fit, and comfort.</p>','IC-TLG-010',22,1,1,'\"[\\\"Flex Stretch Cotton Fabric\\\",\\\"Ergonomic Modern Tailored Fit\\\",\\\"High-Grade Tonal Buttons\\\",\\\"Crease-Resistant Finish\\\"]\"','\"[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fabric\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"96% Cotton, 4% Spandex\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Fit\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Stretch Slim Fit\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"Color\\\",\\\"value\\\