INSERT INTO `reviews` VALUES (2,1,21,5,'The active noise cancellation is astonishing. It cancels out city traffic and ceiling fans effortlessly. The soundstage is wide and punchy with very deep sub-bass.','Unbeatable ANC and acoustic clarity!',NULL,1,1,NULL,1,'2026-07-14 12:54:20','2026-07-14 12:54:20'),(3,3,21,5,'Doesn\'t feel heavy on the crown of the head. Very balanced weight distribution.','Best headphones under this budget','[\"/storage/reviews/1787316244041-245011473.webp\", \"/storage/reviews/1787316244058-108231983.webp\", \"/storage/reviews/1787316244062-326570805.webp\", \"/storage/reviews/1787316244067-780270166.webp\", \"/storage/reviews/1787316244075-192993599.webp\"]',1,1,NULL,5,'2026-07-10 12:54:20','2026-08-21 12:44:04'),(4,4,21,4,'Clear highs and rich mids. Attending Zoom calls is crystal clear without background chatter. Fast charging via Type-C gives 8 hours in just 15 mins.','Great soundstage and microphone','[\"/storage/reviews/1787316528985-265816176.webp\", \"/storage/reviews/1787316528998-677694064.webp\", \"/storage/reviews/1787316529006-20656696.webp\", \"/storage/reviews/1787316529016-702585353.webp\", \"/storage/reviews/1787316529026-19730294.webp\"]',1,1,NULL,19,'2026-04-01 12:54:20','2026-08-21 12:48:49'),(5,5,21,5,'Build quality is stellar with the matte metal headband. Sound separation across classical and rock instruments is top-notch.','Studio-grade quality feel',NULL,1,1,NULL,14,'2026-04-18 12:54:20','2026-04-18 12:54:20'),(6,6,21,5,'If you love punchy EDM or Hip Hop, these drivers deliver deep resonance without muddying vocal clarity.','Bass is deep without distorting vocals',NULL,1,1,NULL,9,'2026-06-05 12:54:20','2026-06-05 12:54:20'),(7,7,21,4,'Wore these for an entire 9-hour work day. Zero ear fatigue or clamping pressure. Bluetooth 5.3 connects instantly to my phone and laptop.','Very comfortable for long work shifts',NULL,1,1,NULL,18,'2026-08-01 12:54:20','2026-08-01 12:54:20'),(8,8,21,5,'High-resolution audio playback over Bluetooth 5.3 is phenomenal. ANC transparency mode sounds completely natural.','A true audiophile companion',NULL,1,1,NULL,0,'2026-03-14 12:54:20','2026-03-14 12:54:20'),(9,9,21,5,'Charged it once last week and it\'s still at 40%. The companion controls on the right ear cup are tactile and clicky.','Battery life seems infinite!',NULL,1,1,NULL,5,'2026-04-28 12:54:20','2026-04-28 12:54:20'),(10,10,21,4,'Love the folding design and the hard-shell travel case included in the box. Excellent build and reliable connectivity.','Premium design with sturdy travel case',NULL,1,1,NULL,10,'2026-02-21 12:54:20','2026-02-21 12:54:20'),(11,11,21,5,'Works like magic in open office spaces. Pure silence allowing me to concentrate on coding.','ANC blocks out office chatter completely',NULL,1,1,NULL,21,'2026-07-16 12:54:21','2026-07-16 12:54:21'),(12,12,21,5,'Low latency audio makes watching 4K movies and playing games super immersive. Gunshots and explosions have great impact.','Immersive gaming and movie experience',NULL,1,1,NULL,23,'2026-05-26 12:54:21','2026-05-26 12:54:21'),(13,13,21,4,'Vocals sound alive and acoustic guitars have a beautiful sparkle. Worth every single rupee.','Crisp treble and rich midrange',NULL,1,1,NULL,5,'2026-04-28 12:54:21','2026-04-28 12:54:21'),(14,14,21,5,'I can switch between my iPhone and MacBook instantly when receiving a phone call. Super convenient.','Seamless dual device multi-point pairing',NULL,1,1,NULL,7,'2026-06-27 12:54:21','2026-06-27 12:54:21'),(15,15,21,5,'The ear cups rotate smoothly and fit snug. Sound profile is balanced with clean separation.','Top tier comfort and sound signature',NULL,1,1,NULL,20,'2026-06-30 12:54:21','2026-06-30 12:54:21'),(16,16,21,4,'Colleagues mentioned my voice was super loud and clear even when I was walking on a windy street.','Impressive microphone background cancellation',NULL,1,1,NULL,10,'2026-05-25 12:54:21','2026-05-25 12:54:21'),(17,17,21,5,'The material finish, headband padding, and sound delivery easily compete with leading flagship brands.','Feels like ₹25,000 headphones',NULL,1,1,NULL,16,'2026-06-21 12:54:21','2026-06-21 12:54:21'),(18,18,21,5,'Zero harmonic distortion at maximum volume. Treble never gets harsh or sibilant.','Clean sound even at 100% volume',NULL,1,1,NULL,15,'2026-05-16 12:54:21','2026-05-16 12:54:21'),(19,19,21,4,'Arrived in pristine condition. Pairing was seamless and the audio quality exceeded my expectations.','Solid packaging and quick delivery',NULL,1,1,NULL,4,'2026-05-08 12:54:21','2026-05-08 12:54:21'),(20,20,21,5,'You can talk to people without taking off the headphones. The exterior microphones pick up natural room acoustics.','Transparency mode is very lifelike',NULL,1,1,NULL,16,'2026-04-23 12:54:21','2026-04-23 12:54:21'),(21,21,21,5,'The dynamic neodymium drivers produce accurate transients. Best purchase of the year!','Exceptional build and audio tuning',NULL,1,1,NULL,10,'2026-06-05 12:54:21','2026-06-05 12:54:21'),(22,22,21,4,'Offers 95% of high-end headphone performance at a fraction of the cost. Highly recommended.','Great value for money audiophile gear',NULL,1,1,NULL,19,'2026-06-07 12:54:21','2026-06-07 12:54:21'),(23,23,21,5,'Rediscovered nuances in my favorite albums that I never heard on ordinary earphones.','Music sounds alive again',NULL,1,1,NULL,22,'2026-03-29 12:54:21','2026-03-29 12:54:21'),(24,24,21,5,'I can leave my phone in the bedroom and walk to the kitchen without a single audio stutter.','Superb wireless range across 2 rooms',NULL,1,1,NULL,20,'2026-08-13 12:54:22','2026-08-13 12:54:22'),(25,25,21,4,'Doesn\'t feel heavy on the crown of the head. Very balanced weight distribution.','Comfortable ear padding and light weight',NULL,1,1,NULL,24,'2026-04-03 12:54:22','2026-04-03 12:54:22'),(26,26,21,5,'The hybrid ANC technology coupled with deep bass makes this an absolute winner.','Five stars without hesitation',NULL,1,1,NULL,4,'2026-08-04 12:54:22','2026-08-04 12:54:22'),(27,27,21,5,'Subway and bus engine noises disappear the moment ANC is activated. Pure musical bliss.','Perfect companion for daily commute',NULL,1,1,NULL,11,'2026-03-18 12:54:22','2026-03-18 12:54:22'),(28,28,21,4,'No lip-sync delay when watching Netflix or YouTube videos. Bluetooth 5.3 is rock solid.','Smooth Bluetooth sync with zero delay',NULL,1,1,NULL,10,'2026-07-27 12:54:22','2026-07-27 12:54:22'),(29,29,21,5,'Physical click buttons are so much better than finicky touch controls. Volume and track skip are effortless.','Flawless physical buttons',NULL,1,1,NULL,22,'2026-07-26 12:54:22','2026-07-26 12:54:22'),(30,30,21,5,'Matte gunmetal finish looks stealthy and premium. Doesn\'t attract fingerprint smudges.','Exquisite industrial design',NULL,1,1,NULL,24,'2026-02-25 12:54:22','2026-02-25 12:54:22'),(31,31,21,4,'Instrument separation in orchestral pieces is phenomenal. Drums and bass lines have crisp attack.','Audio clarity is pristine',NULL,1,1,NULL,13,'2026-05-26 12:54:22','2026-05-26 12:54:22'),(32,32,21,5,'I only charge this twice a month despite daily gym and commute usage. Phenomenal power management.','Massive battery reserve',NULL,1,1,NULL,2,'2026-04-02 12:54:22','2026-04-02 12:54:22'),(33,33,21,5,'Breathable synthetic leather ear pads prevent sweaty ears during long listening sessions.','Comfortable even after 6 hours',NULL,1,1,NULL,7,'2026-07-10 12:54:22','2026-07-10 12:54:22'),(34,34,21,4,'Bass is authoritative and tight without overpowering the delicate vocal harmonies.','Deep bass lovers will rejoice',NULL,1,1,NULL,13,'2026-08-08 12:54:22','2026-08-08 12:54:22'),(35,35,21,5,'Bought this for my brother and he was blown away by the clarity and noise cancellation.','Best gift for music enthusiasts',NULL,1,1,NULL,19,'2026-04-28 12:54:22','2026-04-28 12:54:22'),(36,36,21,5,'Multiple beamforming mics isolate speech effortlessly. Best headset for work from home.','Crystal clear call quality',NULL,1,1,NULL,12,'2026-07-28 12:54:22','2026-07-28 12:54:22'),(37,37,21,4,'The swivel hinges are reinforced with metal and feel like they will last for years.','Sturdy hinge mechanism',NULL,1,1,NULL,21,'2026-03-08 12:54:22','2026-03-08 12:54:22'),(38,38,21,5,'Harman-target style sound signature that makes all genres from jazz to heavy metal sound thrilling.','Audiophile sound curve',NULL,1,1,NULL,8,'2026-03-04 12:54:22','2026-03-04 12:54:22'),(39,39,21,5,'Includes 3.5mm backup audio cable, Type-C charging cable, and hard travel case. Total satisfaction.','Spectacular overall package',NULL,1,1,NULL,16,'2026-06-29 12:54:22','2026-06-29 12:54:22'),(40,40,21,4,'Forgot to charge overnight, plugged in for 10 minutes while getting ready and had enough juice for the day.','Quick charging saved my morning',NULL,1,1,NULL,6,'2026-05-24 12:54:23','2026-05-24 12:54:23'),(41,41,21,5,'The thick ear cups provide solid passive seal, and ANC completely removes remaining low rumble.','Noise isolation even without ANC',NULL,1,1,NULL,17,'2026-04-25 12:54:23','2026-04-25 12:54:23'),(42,42,21,5,'Helps me focus entirely in noisy hostel environments. Couldn\'t study without it.','Pure bliss for study sessions',NULL,1,1,NULL,6,'2026-04-17 12:54:23','2026-04-17 12:54:23'),(43,43,21,4,'Subtle branding and clean contours. Looks very classy in professional office meetings.','Sleek and minimalist aesthetics',NULL,1,1,NULL,11,'2026-07-19 12:54:23','2026-07-19 12:54:23'),(44,44,21,5,'3D spatial audio feels like being sitting in the middle of a concert hall.','Sound immersion is unreal',NULL,1,1,NULL,17,'2026-06-16 12:54:23','2026-06-16 12:54:23'),(45,45,21,5,'Handles complex synthesizer tracks without sounding congested or harsh.','High dynamic range playback',NULL,1,1,NULL,2,'2026-06-26 12:54:23','2026-06-26 12:54:23'),(46,46,21,4,'Has never dropped connection even in crowded metro stations with multiple RF interferences.','Robust wireless connection',NULL,1,1,NULL,11,'2026-06-03 12:54:23','2026-06-03 12:54:23'),(47,47,21,5,'I use these for podcast editing and casual mixing. Accurate tonal reproduction.','Top