 Deeply immersive.','1500R curvature wraps around field of view perfectly',NULL,1,1,NULL,6,'2026-08-15 12:54:46','2026-08-15 12:54:46'),(501,6,30,5,'Heavy metal stand supports smooth height, tilt, and swivel adjustments. Does not wobble on the desk when typing.','Fully adjustable ergonomic stand',NULL,1,1,NULL,12,'2026-03-27 12:54:47','2026-03-27 12:54:47'),(502,7,30,4,'Includes dual DisplayPort 1.4, dual HDMI 2.0, and 3.5mm audio jack. Picture-by-Picture mode allows displaying two different computers side-by-side simultaneously.','Multiple input ports with PiP / PbP support',NULL,1,1,NULL,23,'2026-06-29 12:54:47','2026-06-29 12:54:47'),(503,8,30,5,'Screen panel quality is immaculate. Zero dead or stuck pixels upon arrival with uniform black levels across the entire 34-inch canvas.','Zero dead pixels and minimal backlight bleed',NULL,1,1,NULL,14,'2026-05-20 12:54:47','2026-05-20 12:54:47'),(504,9,30,5,'Racing games like Forza and open-world RPGs like Cyberpunk 2077 feel like looking through a spaceship cockpit window. Unmatched peripheral vision advantage.','Ultrawide gaming immersion is unparalleled',NULL,1,1,NULL,0,'2026-06-11 12:54:47','2026-06-11 12:54:47'),(505,10,30,4,'Navigating monitor settings using the 5-way joystick under the bottom bezel is intuitive and fast.','Crisp joystick OSD controls',NULL,1,1,NULL,15,'2026-03-11 12:54:47','2026-03-11 12:54:47'),(506,11,30,5,'Blue light filter and DC dimming prevent eye fatigue during marathon 10-hour programming work sessions.','TUV Certified eye-care and flicker-free technology',NULL,1,1,NULL,5,'2026-04-23 12:54:47','2026-04-23 12:54:47'),(507,12,30,5,'Having IDE, terminal, API documentation, and browser open on a single seamless screen drastically accelerates coding speed.','Massive productivity multiplier for software engineers',NULL,1,1,NULL,6,'2026-02-27 12:54:47','2026-02-27 12:54:47'),(508,13,30,4,'Easily mounted onto a monitor arm with included standoff screws. Cleans up desk space beautifully.','VESA 100x100 wall mount compatible',NULL,1,1,NULL,23,'2026-07-11 12:54:47','2026-07-11 12:54:47'),(509,14,30,5,'Box includes premium DisplayPort cable that easily supports full 3440x1440 at 165Hz with 10-bit color.','Includes high quality DisplayPort 1.4 cable',NULL,1,1,NULL,1,'2026-04-08 12:54:47','2026-04-08 12:54:47'),(510,15,30,5,'Delivers specifications and panel quality comparable to monitor brands charging ₹65,000+. Exceptional value.','Worth every single rupee',NULL,1,1,NULL,7,'2026-07-14 12:54:47','2026-07-14 12:54:47'),(511,16,30,4,'Ambient glow on the back adds a subtle gaming aesthetic in dark room setups without being distracting.','Subtle rear RGB lighting ring',NULL,1,1,NULL,8,'2026-05-11 12:54:47','2026-05-11 12:54:47'),(512,17,30,5,'Delivered in a massive reinforced foam-packed box with zero damage.','Solid packaging and quick delivery',NULL,1,1,NULL,22,'2026-02-25 12:54:47','2026-02-25 12:54:47'),(513,18,30,5,'VA panel delivers rich 3000:1 static contrast ratio, making dark movie scenes look rich and detailed.','Stunning contrast and deep black levels',NULL,1,1,NULL,7,'2026-03-12 12:54:47','2026-03-12 12:54:47'),(514,19,30,4,'Route DP, HDMI, and power cables cleanly through the stand pillar for a clutter-free desk.','Clean cable management cutout in stand',NULL,1,1,NULL,13,'2026-08-18 12:54:47','2026-08-18 12:54:47'),(515,20,30,5,'No annoying plastic bezels down the middle. One continuous curved canvas is infinitely better.','Replaced dual monitor setup completely',NULL,1,1,NULL,19,'2026-04-10 12:54:47','2026-04-10 12:54:47'),(516,21,30,5,'Enabled G-Sync compatible mode on my RTX 4070; buttery smooth variable refresh rate with zero flickering.','Flawless G-Sync and FreeSync compatibility',NULL,1,1,NULL,5,'2026-07-09 12:54:47','2026-07-09 12:54:47'),(517,22,30,4,'Minimal border frames make the screen feel like it floats in front of you.','Ultra slim three-sided bezels',NULL,1,1,NULL,16,'2026-08-09 12:54:47','2026-08-09 12:54:47'),(518,23,30,5,'Spreadsheet analysts and financial traders will appreciate seeing 40+ columns without horizontal scrolling.','Immediate boost in workflow efficiency',NULL,1,1,NULL,11,'2026-06-30 12:54:47','2026-06-30 12:54:47'),(519,24,30,5,'Top tier gaming monitor that doubles as an elite productivity workstation display.','Five stars across the board',NULL,1,1,NULL,6,'2026-03-21 12:54:47','2026-03-21 12:54:47'),(520,25,30,4,'Diffuses window reflections effectively without causing fuzzy grain on white backgrounds.','Good anti-glare matte coating',NULL,1,1,NULL,19,'2026-06-18 12:54:48','2026-06-18 12:54:48'),(521,26,30,5,'Watching 21:9 cinemascope movies fills the entire screen with zero black letterbox bars top and bottom.','HDR movies look rich and vibrant',NULL,1,1,NULL,13,'2026-04-29 12:54:48','2026-04-29 12:54:48'),(522,27,30,5,'Text is sharp and legible without requiring Windows UI scaling.','Sharp pixel density (110 PPI)',NULL,1,1,NULL,8,'2026-07-07 12:54:48','2026-07-07 12:54:48'),(523,28,30,4,'Built-in hardware crosshair, FPS counter, and timer overlays for competitive gaming.','Customizable crosshair and gaming overlays',NULL,1,1,NULL,2,'2026-07-25 12:54:48','2026-07-25 12:54:48'),(524,29,30,5,'Cannot fathom going back to standard 16:9 1080p monitors after using this VisioMax 34-inch.','Best monitor purchase I have ever made',NULL,1,1,NULL,18,'2026-04-14 12:54:48','2026-04-14 12:54:48'),(525,30,30,5,'Stand base is cast aluminum with solid hinges. Zero wobble or sag.','Heavy duty metal construction',NULL,1,1,NULL,13,'2026-03-03 12:54:48','2026-03-03 12:54:48'),(526,31,30,4,'OSD allows assigning quick-switch shortcuts to jump between work laptop and gaming rig.','Quick switching between input sources',NULL,1,1,NULL,22,'2026-06-11 12:54:48','2026-06-11 12:54:48'),(527,32,30,5,'Color temperature and brightness remain consistent across the entire width of the display.','Exceptional color uniformity',NULL,1,1,NULL,10,'2026-07-15 12:54:48','2026-07-15 12:54:48'),(528,33,30,5,'Fluid 165Hz gaming with professional color accuracy. Perfect hybrid display.','A true gamer and creator dream display',NULL,1,1,NULL,12,'2026-07-06 12:54:48','2026-07-06 12:54:48'),(529,34,30,4,'Has calibrated presets for sRGB, Movie, FPS, RTS, and Reader modes.','Intuitive preset color profiles',NULL,1,1,NULL,9,'2026-03-12 12:54:48','2026-03-12 12:54:48'),(530,35,30,5,'Overdrive settings provide clean motion clarity with zero inverse ghosting artifacts.','Superb response time tuning',NULL,1,1,NULL,9,'2026-04-19 12:54:48','2026-04-19 12:54:48'),(531,36,30,5,'If you are on the fence about going ultrawide, this monitor is the absolute best choice.','10/10 purchase recommendation',NULL,1,1,NULL,1,'2026-03-27 12:54:48','2026-03-27 12:54:48'),(532,37,30,4,'Internal power supply runs cool without any buzzing coil whine.','Runs cool and quiet',NULL,1,1,NULL,24,'2026-08-13 12:54:48','2026-08-13 12:54:48'),(533,38,30,5,'Flight Simulator and sim racing feel incredibly realistic with the wide curved wrap-around.','Immersive field of view in simulators',NULL,1,1,NULL,11,'2026-07-05 12:54:48','2026-07-05 12:54:48'),(534,39,30,5,'Unbeatable price to performance ratio in the 34-inch ultrawide segment.','Great value for money',NULL,1,1,NULL,9,'2026-04-30 12:54:48','2026-04-30 12:54:48'),(535,40,30,4,'Stand clicks into place with a quick-release latch with no screws needed.','Easy assembly',NULL,1,1,NULL,13,'2026-03-23 12:54:48','2026-03-23 12:54:48'),(536,41,30,5,'Razor sharp resolution, deep contrast, high refresh rate, and great ergonomics.','Pristine display quality',NULL,1,1,NULL,8,'2026-06-15 12:54:48','2026-06-15 12:54:48'),(537,42,30,5,'165Hz makes every motion feel responsive and instantaneous.','Outstanding gaming performance',NULL,1,1,NULL,19,'2026-03-24 12:54:49','2026-03-24 12:54:49'),(538,43,30,4,'The wide timeline on video editors saves massive scrubbing time.','Great for video editing',NULL,1,1,NULL,14,'2026-08-15 12:54:49','2026-08-15 12:54:49'),(539,44,30,5,'Arrived in flawless condition with beautiful panel uniformity.','Zero dead pixels',NULL,1,1,NULL,1,'2026-05-10 12:54:49','2026-05-10 12:54:49'),(540,45,30,5,'A top-tier gaming monitor with spectacular productivity benefits.','Highly recommended',NULL,1,1,NULL,16,'2026-03-25 12:54:49','2026-03-25 12:54:49'),(541,46,30,4,'Minimalist stealth design that fits professional and gaming spaces alike.','Clean styling',NULL,1,1,NULL,11,'2026-03-02 12:54:49','2026-03-02 12:54:49'),(542,47,30,5,'Best curved monitor on the market for the price.','Five stars all the way',NULL,1,1,NULL,10,'2026-06-14 12:54:49','2026-06-14 12:54:49'),(543,48,30,5,'Allows true multitasking without dual monitor bezels.','Incredible real estate',NULL,1,1,NULL,6,'2026-05-17 12:54:49','2026-05-17 12:54:49'),(544,49,30,4,'Fast pixel response ensures crystal clear motion in fast games.','Smooth motion clarity',NULL,1,1,NULL,11,'2026-06-23 12:54:49','2026-06-23 12:54:49'),(545,50,30,5,'Vibrant colors and deep blacks. Very impressed.','Top notch panel',NULL,1,1,NULL,1,'2026-03-26 12:54:49','2026-03-26 12:54:49'),(546,51,30,5,'Superb 34-inch curved gaming display.','Definite five stars',NULL,1,1,NULL,8,'2026-03-12 12:54:49','2026-03-12 12:54:49'),(547,52,30,4,'Height adjustment range is generous and smooth.','Solid ergonomics',NULL,1,1,NULL,21,'2026-06-30 12:54:50','2026-06-30 12:54:50'),(548,53,30,5,'Colors, speed, curve, and resolution are all top tier.','Awesome display',NULL,1,1,NULL,6,'2026-03-07 12:54:50','2026-03-07 12:54:50'),(549,54,30,5,'Has significantly boosted my work productivity and gaming enjoyment.','Great investment',NULL,1,1,NULL,19,'2026-05-07 12:54:50','2026-05-07 12:54:50'),(550,55,30,4,'Multiple DP and HDMI inputs make connecting multiple PCs easy.','Good connectivity',NULL,1,1,NULL,14,'2026-06-18 12:54:50','2026-06-18 12:54:50'),(551,56,30,5,'The ultimate 34-inch curved gaming and productivity monitor!','Highest recommendation',NULL,1,1,NULL,13,'2026-06-25 12:54:50','2026-06-25 12:54:50');
